## Investigation Workflow

The activities developed a basic endpoint investigation workflow:

```text
Windows Endpoint
       ↓
Event / Process Activity
       ↓
PowerShell Investigation
       ↓
Process / Service / Startup Analysis
       ↓
Network / DNS Investigation
       ↓
File Hash Verification
       ↓
Event Correlation
       ↓
Security Assessment
```

